  "description": "'Ormond Cottage' is a rare terrace-style residence tucked within a boutique collection of just four homes in one of Paddington's original Victorian residences. Spanning three spacious levels, this charming home offers the feel and functionality of a traditional Paddington terrace, paired with the ease of apartment living. Beautifully presented and rich in character, the home features two generous bedrooms, two bathrooms and multiple outdoor entertaining spaces including a sun-soaked front courtyard and private rooftop terrace enjoying elevated district outlooks with glimpses of the Harbour Bridge and Sydney Tower. Positioned in the very heart of Paddington, just footsteps from Oxford Street and moments to Five Ways village, this is an exceptional lifestyle opportunity within one of the suburb's most tightly held pockets. Features: • Boutique block of only four residences • Terrace-style apartment spanning three generous levels • Two bedrooms, two bathrooms and multiple living zones • Sunny front courtyard plus private rooftop entertaining terrace • Harbour Bridge glimpses and Sydney Tower views • Updated upstairs bathroom completed in recent years • Gas kitchen, split-system air conditioning and internal laundry • Positioned within one of Paddington's original Victorian homes • Metres to Oxford Street, Five Ways cafes, pubs and restaurants",
